response:
The incident involves threat actor UAC-0098 distributing the archive НакладенняШтрафнихСанкцiй.zip impersonating the State Tax Service of Ukraine. The archive contains the malicious document Накладення штрафних санкцій.docx, which exploits CVE-2022-30190 to download index.html from 64.190.113.51 and subsequently ked.dll (Cobalt Strike Beacon) from 5.199.173.152.

